\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  My heart is in heaven,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Perfect dwelling place,
\par Devoid of transgression,
\par And worries as well.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Who is it that with me,
\par Shall go to that heaven,
\par Where the Lord our father,
\par Reigns eternally?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Our master is the way.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 That leads to that heaven,
\par Jesus Christ is the way
\par Therefore go by Him,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Faithfully keep Him safe,
\par Well within your heart,
\par Make Him your possession
\par While you be His son.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

